{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人方力申於2025年宣布已與葉萱結婚，年末二人愛女方愛嘉（Isla）出生，一家三口幸福滿瀉。</p><p>今日（20日），方力申透過社交平台公布太太兩個月前懷孕，並由女兒Isla以套娃形式公布BB性別，結果係男仔，湊成「好」字。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:00.816899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:20:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:14.377631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:14.377631+00:00","content_hash":"100537faf9626c6f504933a5299d70f9fe01b0a777c2a1cd0050a92b0b167f84","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}